      <h2>03 — Developer Tool · AWFL Sitemap Builder</h2>
      <p>The <strong>AWFL Sitemap Builder</strong> is a PHP-based developer tool created by AEDTP WORLD. It provides a visual file-manager-style interface to automatically generate, update, and manage <code>sitemap.xml</code> files for websites — no manual XML editing required.</p>
      <div class="warning-block">⚠️ Only <strong>.html</strong> files are accepted into the sitemap. Other file types are intentionally ignored.</div>
      <h4>✨ Core Capabilities</h4>
      <ul class="capabilities-list">
        <li>Browse folders and subfolders in a file-manager-style UI</li>
        <li>Select which directories to include in the sitemap</li>
        <li>Auto-generate sitemap.xml at root next to sitemap.php</li>
        <li>Auto-update and rebuild sitemap on demand</li>
        <li>Auto-remove stale/missing entries on every build or rebuild</li>
        <li>View raw sitemap.xml contents inside the interface</li>
        <li>Auto-generate sitemap.php and list_files.php via sitemapbuilderawfl.php</li>
        <li>Password-protected builder access</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

